      },
      {
        "text": "Growing up in Hawaii shaped my deep connection to the ocean and outdoor life.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I enjoyed surfing and spending time outdoors more than being on land.",
        "confidence": 0.92
