    "turn_text": "did. I want to ask you a question that kind of morphs your love of your home with the job where I met you. You represented a state that many people would forego their braces on their kid's teeth to go visit. They would, I mean, they would do anything to go visit your state. It is perceived as being just incredibly beautiful. And yet you had to get on a plane and fly for God knows how long to go to Washington DC. And I just want you to give people a sense. I mean, they kind of laugh when we use the phrase public servant I felt sorry for the people that lived in Hawaii in California because of the length of their travel. Tell us what your life was like, trying to represent Hawaii, but also make it in time for votes.",
