    "turn_text": "And just so our listeners are clear, your service and uniform is not in the past tense. It is in the present tense. You continue to serve. And yes. And I do wonder, so Seth Molten was on with me not long ago. My Gallagher was not on, was on not that long ago. I do wonder if everyone who made decisions about war also had to wage those wars, what the difference would be. I mentioned you Seth and Mike, because you all served in uniform, you currently serve. But I wonder, sending other people off to fight battles is very different from sending yourself off to fight battles. I wonder if our decision making would be different if it were our sons and daughters, literally or ourselves. Yeah.",
